# UI Migration PRD (No Logic Changes)
Project: ChessHub  
Goal: Replace UI/UX layer with v0-inspired design while preserving all existing application behavior and backend contracts.

---

## 1) Scope and Constraints

### In Scope
- Replace page JSX layout
- Replace visual components
- Replace styling/theme/tokens
- Replace non-logic UI wrappers/shell

### Out of Scope (Must NOT change)
- API endpoints and request/response contracts
- Auth/session logic
- Zustand store behavior
- Realtime socket event names/payloads
- Chess/gameplay validation logic
- Database schema and backend business logic

---

## 2) Core Principle

**UI-only migration.**  
Existing logic must continue to work exactly as before; only presentation and UX structure are replaced.

---

## 3) Definition of Success

- App flow: Landing -> Login/Register -> Dashboard
- Existing features still work end-to-end:
  - Auth
  - Dashboard data
  - Friend game creation/join/realtime gameplay
  - AI game creation/moves/results
- No breaking TypeScript/build errors
- No backend contract changes required

---

## 4) Migration Order (Required)

### Phase 1: Landing + Login + Register
- [x] Add landing page route and UI
- [x] Replace login page UI with v0-inspired layout
- [x] Replace register page UI with v0-inspired layout
- [x] Preserve current submit handlers, validations, and navigation logic
- [x] Verify auth flow still redirects to dashboard on success

### Phase 2: Dashboard
- [x] Replace dashboard page layout and card structure
- [x] Keep current dashboard data fetching and stats logic
- [x] Keep navigation actions wired to existing routes
- [x] Keep recent games rendering using existing API fields

### Phase 3: New Game + AI New
- [x] Replace `/new-game` UI to v0-inspired control cards
- [x] Replace `/ai-game/new` setup UI to v0-inspired controls
- [x] Keep existing create handlers and payloads unchanged
- [x] Keep error/loading states functional

### Phase 4: Friend Game + AI Game In-Play
- [x] Replace friend game in-play screen visual layout
- [x] Replace AI game in-play screen visual layout
- [x] Keep board behavior, move submit logic, action buttons, and status logic unchanged
- [x] Keep illegal move handling and user feedback intact

### Phase 5: Sidebar/Shell Consistency Pass
- [x] Standardize app shell/sidebar visual system across protected pages
- [x] Ensure desktop fixed + mobile collapsible behavior remains
- [x] Ensure placeholders (Game History, Settings) match visual language
- [x] Ensure spacing/typography/colors are consistent globally

---

## 5) File-Level Guardrails

### Logic Files (Do Not Modify unless strictly required by UI import path only)
- [ ] `client/src/lib/api.ts`
- [ ] `client/src/store/authStore.ts`
- [ ] Socket/game logic files
- [ ] Backend routes/services

### UI Migration Target Files
- [x] `client/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx` (new/replace)
- [x] `client/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx`
- [x] `client/src/pages/RegisterPage.tsx`
- [x] `client/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx`
- [x] `client/src/pages/NewGamePage.tsx`
- [x] `client/src/pages/AiGamePage.tsx`
- [x] `client/src/pages/FriendGamePage.tsx`
- [x] `client/src/components/AppShell.tsx` (consistency pass)
- [x] `client/src/style.css` and/or Tailwind token layer

---

## 6) Next.js to React(Vite) Conversion Rules

- [x] Replace `next/link` with `react-router-dom` `Link`/`NavLink`
- [x] Replace `next/image` with `img` (or existing image pattern)
- [x] Do not copy Next route structure (`app/...`) as runtime routing
- [x] Copy layout/sections/components styling only
- [x] Keep React Router route ownership in `client/src/App.tsx`

---

## 7) Component Strategy

- [x] Reuse existing shadcn-style primitives in project (`button`, `card`, `badge`)
- [x] Add additional UI primitives only when needed by migrated page
- [x] Keep UI components presentation-focused (no business logic inside)
- [x] Prefer composition over rewriting logic-heavy page functions

---

## 8) QA Checklist Per Phase

For each migrated phase:
- [x] `npm run build` passes (client)
- [x] No new linter/type errors
- [x] Existing page logic behavior unchanged
- [x] API requests unchanged in shape
- [x] Loading/error/disabled states still present
- [x] Navigation paths still correct

---

## 9) Manual Smoke Tests (Post-Migration)

### Auth
- [ ] Register works
- [ ] Login works
- [ ] Redirect to dashboard works

### Dashboard
- [ ] Stats load correctly
- [ ] Recent games load correctly
- [ ] CTA buttons route correctly

### Friend Game
- [ ] Create game works
- [ ] Join game works via shared link
- [ ] Realtime sync works
- [ ] Move validation/errors still work
- [ ] Resign/draw flows still work

### AI Game
- [ ] Create AI game works
- [ ] Move submission works
- [ ] AI response works
- [ ] Illegal move errors still display correctly

---

## 10) Rollback Plan

- [ ] Migrate phase-by-phase (commit per phase)
- [ ] If regression appears, revert only latest phase
- [ ] Never mix multi-phase UI rewrites in one large unverified change

---

## 11) Exit Criteria

- [x] All 5 phases complete
- [ ] All smoke tests pass
- [x] UI matches v0-inspired design direction
- [x] Logic/contracts unchanged
- [x] App remains stable and deployable
